						 <div class="logo"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/estrellayoshte/logo.png" alt="logo.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="anchor"> <div class="sidebox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">最新页面：</span></span></h3> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/estrellayoshte">EstrellaYoshte的作者页</a> [+25]</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">我推荐的页面：</span></span></h3> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">我的艺桌页</a> - 我设计的所有标志都在这里。</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5552">SCP-5552</a> - 我最爱的SCP之一。</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/artpage-fartpage">lynch的艺作屁作</a> - 一个很酷很有趣的3D艺作页！</p> <p><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:flopstyle">Flopstyle CSS</a> - 非常floppy。</p> </div> </div> <div class="header-container"> <div class="text-item"> <p><span style="font-size:90%;"><span style="color: grey"><strong>合格？</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:220%;"><strong>完全</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="text-item"> <p><span style="font-size:90%;"><span style="color: grey"><strong>项目等级：</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:220%;"><strong>RADICAL</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="grid-item"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/estrellayoshte/u.png" style="width:300px;" alt="u.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>一张所谓的自画像。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="textbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">我的自传：</span></span></h2> <p>lol不要，那看起来好累<br /> 当然好像是挺酷挺有趣的<br /> 然而我懒到完全不想写它<br /> 但是你也可以假装我写了</p> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div id="wiki-tabview-5e1a9833087a7d356f4b652b00f6e794" class="yui-na